# CashPilot status

## Current status
- Engine contracts and logic are in place and aligned with the verified dataset.
- API, agent, action store, monitor, frontend, and deployment scaffolding have been added as a working starter foundation.
- This repo now includes the missing app and orchestration layers needed to start the backend and dashboard.

## Next actions
- Install Python dependencies with `pip install -r backend/requirements.txt`.
- Start the API with `cd backend && uvicorn app.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000`.
- Start the Streamlit dashboard with `cd frontend && streamlit run app.py`.
- Validate the engine tests with `cd backend && pytest -q`.
